OL,3,AMan arrested after Swiss rave shooting
OL,4,Athat killed woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old Swiss man has been
OL,7,Farrested following a shooting at a rave
OL,8,Fin Switzerland in which a woman was
OL,9,Fkilled.
OL,11,FItalian 22-year-old Maria Spinelli was
OL,12,Fkilled and several others injured at a
OL,13,Ftechno rave being held at a horse
OL,14,Fracing track in Aarau, a town about
OL,15,F46km (29 miles) west of Zurich on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,18,FThe shooting initiated a nearly 24-hour
OL,19,Fmanhunt before Aarau cantonal police
OL,20,Fconfirmed they apprehended the suspect
OL,21,Fshortly before 01:00 local time on
OL,22,FMonday (23:00 GMT on Sunday).
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
