OL,3,A'She slipped out of my hand' - children
OL,4,Amissing after ferry sinks off northern
OL,5,ACyprus
OL,6,
OL,7,FAyten Bicer felt her 12-year-old
OL,8,Fdaughter slip from her grasp and
OL,9,Fdisappear as the ferry they were
OL,10,Ftravelling on capsized off the coast of
OL,11,Fnorthern Cyprus on Sunday, killing
OL,12,Feight people.
OL,14,FHer daughter Miray and six-year-old son
OL,15,FMemhet Asaf are among 20 people still
OL,16,Fmissing after the vessel sunk while en
OL,17,Froute to Turkey from the coastal town
OL,18,Fof Kyrenia, in the self-proclaimed
OL,19,FTurkish republic on Cyprus.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
